{
  "id": "EXO.22",
  "number": "22",
  "bookId": "EXO",
  "reference": "Exodus 22",
  "copyright": "PUBLIC DOMAIN except in the United Kingdom, where a Crown Copyright applies to printing the KJV. See http://www.cambridge.org/about-us/who-we-are/queens-printers-patent",
  "verseCount": 31,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "22",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "EXO 22"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "22",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 22:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "If a man shall steal an ox, or a sheep, and kill it, or sell it; he shall restore five oxen for an ox, and four sheep for a sheep.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.22.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.21.37"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 22:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "¶ If a thief be found breaking up, and be smitten that he die,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.22.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.22.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "there shall",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EXO.22.2",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EXO.22.1"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "no blood",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.22.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.22.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "be shed",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EXO.22.2",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EXO.22.1"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "for him.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.22.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.22.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 22:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "If the sun be risen upon him,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.22.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.22.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "there shall be",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EXO.22.3",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EXO.22.2"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "blood",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.22.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.22.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "shed",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EXO.22.3",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EXO.22.2"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "for him;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.22.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.22.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "for",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EXO.22.3",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EXO.22.2"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "he should make full restitution; if he have nothing, then he shall be sold for his theft.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.22.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.22.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 22:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "If the theft be certainly found in his hand alive, whether it be ox, or ass, or sheep; he shall restore double.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.22.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.22.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 22:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "¶ If a man shall cause a field or vineyard to be eaten, and shall put in his beast, and shall feed in another man's field; of the best of his own field, and of the best of his own vineyard, shall he make restitution.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.22.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.22.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 22:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "¶ If fire break out, and catch in thorns, so that the stacks of corn, or the standing corn, or the field, be consumed",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.22.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.22.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "therewith;",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EXO.22.6",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EXO.22.5"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "he that kindled the fire shall surely make restitution.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.22.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.22.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 22:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "¶ If a man shall deliver unto his neighbour money or stuff to keep, and it be stolen out of the man's house; if the thief be found, let him pay double.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.22.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.22.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 22:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "If the thief be not found, then the master of the house shall be brought unto the judges,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.22.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.22.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "to see",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EXO.22.8",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EXO.22.7"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "whether he have put his hand unto his neighbour's goods.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.22.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.22.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 22:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For all manner of trespass,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.22.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.22.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "whether it be",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EXO.22.9",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EXO.22.8"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "for ox, for ass, for sheep, for raiment,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.22.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.22.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "or",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EXO.22.9",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EXO.22.8"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "for any manner of lost thing, which",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.22.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.22.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "another",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EXO.22.9",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EXO.22.8"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "challengeth to be his, the cause of both parties shall come before the judges;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.22.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.22.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "and",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EXO.22.9",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EXO.22.8"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "whom the judges shall condemn, he shall pay double unto his neighbour.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.22.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.22.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 22:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "If a man deliver unto his neighbour an ass, or an ox, or a sheep, or any beast, to keep; and it die, or be hurt, or driven away, no man seeing",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.22.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.22.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "it:",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EXO.22.10",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EXO.22.9"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.22.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.22.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 22:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Then",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EXO.22.11",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EXO.22.10"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "shall an oath of the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.22.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.22.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EXO.22.11",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EXO.22.10"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "be between them both, that he hath not put his hand unto his neighbour's goods; and the owner of it shall accept",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.22.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.22.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "thereof",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EXO.22.11",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EXO.22.10"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", and he shall not make",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.22.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.22.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "it",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EXO.22.11",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EXO.22.10"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "good.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.22.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.22.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 22:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And if it be stolen from him, he shall make restitution unto the owner thereof.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.22.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.22.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 22:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "If it be torn in pieces,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.22.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.22.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "then",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EXO.22.13",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EXO.22.12"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "let him bring it",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.22.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.22.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "for",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EXO.22.13",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EXO.22.12"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "witness,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.22.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.22.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "and",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EXO.22.13",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EXO.22.12"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "he shall not make good that which was torn.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.22.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.22.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 22:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "¶ And if a man borrow",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.22.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.22.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "ought",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EXO.22.14",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EXO.22.13"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "of his neighbour, and it be hurt, or die, the owner thereof",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.22.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.22.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "being",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EXO.22.14",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EXO.22.13"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "not with it, he shall surely make",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.22.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.22.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "it",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EXO.22.14",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EXO.22.13"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "good.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.22.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.22.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 22:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
