          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.22.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.22.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 22:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "¶ And if a man entice a maid that is not betrothed, and lie with her, he shall surely endow her to be his wife.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.22.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.22.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 22:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "If her father utterly refuse to give her unto him, he shall pay money according to the dowry of virgins.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.22.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.22.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 22:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "¶ Thou shalt not suffer a witch to live.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.22.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.22.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 22:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "¶ Whosoever lieth with a beast shall surely be put to death.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.22.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.22.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 22:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "¶ He that sacrificeth unto",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.22.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.22.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "any",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EXO.22.20",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EXO.22.19"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "god, save unto the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.22.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.22.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EXO.22.20",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EXO.22.19"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "only, he shall be utterly destroyed.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.22.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.22.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 22:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "¶ Thou shalt neither vex a stranger, nor oppress him: for ye were strangers in the land of Egypt.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.22.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.22.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 22:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "¶ Ye shall not afflict any widow, or fatherless child.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.22.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.22.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 22:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "If thou afflict them in any wise, and they cry at all unto me, I will surely hear their cry;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.22.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.22.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 22:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And my wrath shall wax hot, and I will kill you with the sword; and your wives shall be widows, and your children fatherless.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.22.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.22.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 22:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "¶ If thou lend money to",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.22.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.22.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "any of",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EXO.22.25",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EXO.22.24"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "my people",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.22.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.22.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "that is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EXO.22.25",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EXO.22.24"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "poor by thee, thou shalt not be to him as an usurer, neither shalt thou lay upon him usury.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.22.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.22.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 22:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "If thou at all take thy neighbour's raiment to pledge, thou shalt deliver it unto him by that the sun goeth down:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.22.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.22.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 22:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For that",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.22.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.22.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EXO.22.27",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EXO.22.26"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "his covering only, it",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.22.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.22.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EXO.22.27",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EXO.22.26"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "his raiment for his skin: wherein shall he sleep? and it shall come to pass, when he crieth unto me, that I will hear; for I",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.22.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.22.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "am",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EXO.22.27",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EXO.22.26"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "gracious.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.22.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.22.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
